to the farm to start over.

00:08:54.274 --> 00:08:56.874
Director, give me another chance!

00:08:56.874 --> 00:08:58.474
Number 68, get in there!

00:08:58.474 --> 00:08:59.814
Yes, sir!

00:09:07.384 --> 00:09:09.124
