00:09:15.924 --> 00:09:17.594
Prediction from Unit A!

00:09:26.744 --> 00:09:28.934
A gas station's on fire?

00:09:29.204 --> 00:09:33.184
Prediction probability at 70... 72... Still rising.

00:09:33.184 --> 00:09:35.514
Hurry up with the specific time and place!

00:09:35.514 --> 00:09:37.054
Minamoto!

00:09:37.054 --> 00:09:38.104
