to break out in this situation.

00:09:55.734 --> 00:09:58.674
Of course, I'd like to think that too, but...

00:09:58.674 --> 00:10:01.674
The prediction probability for this is 86%!

00:10:01.674 --> 00:10:03.974
And that number hasn't changed.

00:10:03.974 --> 00:10:06.074
Everyone, stand by and be ready for that fire.

00:10:10.914 --> 00:10:12.614
What's that noise?

00:10:16.524 --> 00:10:17.724
