00:10:17.724 --> 00:10:19.494
Is that the source of the prediction?!

00:10:19.494 --> 00:10:21.624
Don't just stand there, Minamoto!

00:10:23.634 --> 00:10:24.294
Kaoru?!

00:10:24.294 --> 00:10:26.264
