00:10:29.534 --> 00:10:31.934
Now, get things started before we go home!

00:10:32.334 --> 00:10:33.774
Those girls...

00:10:33.774 --> 00:10:38.074
All right! Special esper team The Children!

00:10:41.784 --> 00:10:43.244
Released!

00:10:43.384 --> 00:10:44.814
<<RELEASED>>

00:10:50.154 --> 00:10:51.594
Let's do it!

00:10:51.594 --> 00:10:54.654
PSYCHIC AIR POINTING!

00:11:00.104 --> 00:11:01.904
Okay! Go, Aoi!

00:11:01.904 --> 00:11:03.564
Leave it to me!

00:11:09.474 --> 00:11:11.844
Shiho, the pilot!

00:11:11.844 --> 00:11:13.434
Hang on.

00:11:17.014 --> 00:11:20.474
Heart spasms. He's having a heart attack.

00:11:20.584 --> 00:11:23.554
He needs treatment, fast.
His brain's already losing oxygen!

00:11:23.994 --> 00:11:26.684
Roger! Teleporting to the ambulance!

00:11:28.124 --> 00:11:31.684
Yes, well done! What a feat for The Children!

00:11:32.064 --> 00:11:35.164
As to be expected of our nation's finest espers!

00:11:35.164 --> 00:11:37.074
But, Chief...

00:11:37.074 --> 00:11:40.734
Incident probability is 86%! No change!

00:11:40.974 --> 00:11:41.674
What?

00:11:41.674 --> 00:11:42.944
No, wait! What are you?!

00:11:42.944 --> 00:11:45.544
Oh, come on! I'm trying to save the guy!

00:11:45.544 --> 00:11:47.984
I'll give him a psychokinetic heart massage!

00:11:47.984 --> 00:11:49.344
I've always wanted to try that!

00:11:49.344 --> 00:11:51.254
We learned it in our practical ESP training.

00:11:51.254 --> 00:11:52.414
Sounds fun.

00:11:52.414 --> 00:11:54.384
Leave it to the EMTs! You have to-

00:11:54.384 --> 00:11:55.984
More orders?!

00:11:56.624 --> 00:11:58.714
I'm sick of all these orders!

00:11:59.094 --> 00:12:01.454
Which means... PSYCHIC...

00:12:03.834 --> 00:12:05.694
HEART MASSAGE!

00:12:09.134 --> 00:12:11.074
His heart's beating normally!

00:12:11.074 --> 00:12:12.674
Amazing! They've saved him!

00:12:12.674 --> 00:12:14.344
Okay, let's move it!

00:12:14.344 --> 00:12:15.874
Transporting injured patient!

00:12:15.874 --> 00:12:18.174
Get ready to roll!

00:12:19.984 --> 00:12:21.074
K-Kaoru!

00:12:22.614 --> 00:12:24.684
What? It worked, didn't it?

00:12:24.684 --> 00:12:26.274
No! THE PLANE!

00:12:35.794 --> 00:12:37.884
Always be charming, right?

00:12:40.964 --> 00:12:42.904
A nightingale sings in Ancient Kyoto.

00:12:47.174 --> 00:12:49.644
It's not my fault!

00:12:51.974 --> 00:12:54.644
Then how did this happen?

00:12:54.644 --> 00:12:56.514
It was an accident, okay?! Act of God!

00:12:56.514 --> 00:12:58.054
There wasn't any other damage.

00:12:58.054 --> 00:13:02.214
The one lucky thing was that you were the
one hurt worst in this, Mr. Minamoto!

00:13:02.654 --> 00:13:04.654
Since it wasn't anyone's fault,

00:13:04.654 --> 00:13:07.454
