nurses issue of EroEro Comics!

00:13:14.434 --> 00:13:16.734
Here! I'll slice up this melon for you.

00:13:19.204 --> 00:13:22.774
Are you kidding me?!
I'M responsible for that accident!

00:13:22.774 --> 00:13:26.004
I keep telling you! At the scene, follow orders!

00:13:26.914 --> 00:13:30.384
Well, someone sure looks lively!

00:13:30.384 --> 00:13:32.114
Sakaki.

00:13:34.954 --> 00:13:38.414
