I can diagnose a patient with just
a touch. The Psycho Doctor!

00:13:46.564 --> 00:13:49.124
Okay, next we give you shrimps a detailed exam.

00:13:51.734 --> 00:13:54.574
There are things which can
affect our abilities as espers,

00:13:54.574 --> 00:13:57.044
