00:14:05.954 --> 00:14:09.794
So, your duty is to give them detailed
exams after each mission, right?

00:14:09.794 --> 00:14:12.484
C'mon, can we just get this over with?

00:14:14.064 --> 00:14:16.534
Okay, on the scanner bed, one at a time.

00:14:16.534 --> 00:14:17.494
Right...

00:14:20.534 --> 00:14:23.104
