mags while he's scanning you!

00:14:23.104 --> 00:14:26.034
Nurse cosplay is pretty hot, huh, Kaoru?

00:14:26.034 --> 00:14:27.404
Sakaki!

00:14:27.404 --> 00:14:29.564
You like it too, huh?
You like it too, huh?

00:14:31.374 --> 00:14:33.484
Or maybe you're more into the real gals...

00:14:33.484 --> 00:14:36.144
you watch growing up in front of you every day.

00:14:36.214 --> 00:14:38.374
No! Would you be serious?!

00:14:39.454 --> 00:14:43.044
So why are you thinking "Kids
these days develop so nicely?"

00:14:44.594 --> 00:14:45.624
Whoa, seriously?!

00:14:45.624 --> 00:14:48.494
Gross! Is that how you see us, Mr. Minamoto?!

00:14:48.494 --> 00:14:50.864
Don't go spreading rumors about me!

00:14:50.864 --> 00:14:54.234
You may be espers, but you're
still just ten-year-old kids!

00:14:54.234 --> 00:14:56.824
Why can't you act like normal kids your age?!

00:15:02.474 --> 00:15:04.274
Oh, get real.

00:15:06.344 --> 00:15:08.944
We're Level 7's.

00:15:08.944 --> 00:15:11.714
We've never been to kindergarten
or elementary school.

00:15:11.714 --> 00:15:14.204
The only "normal kids" we've
ever seen are on TV.

00:15:16.654 --> 00:15:18.384
Okay, we're done here.

00:15:19.194 --> 00:15:21.054
Wait! I don't have your scan results yet!

00:15:21.494 --> 00:15:23.464
The patient says that she's fine.

00:15:26.294 --> 00:15:29.134
Do you know how much one
of those things costs?!

00:15:29.704 --> 00:15:31.674
You...

00:15:34.744 --> 00:15:35.644
Yes?

00:15:35.644 --> 00:15:38.004
Minamoto, are The Children ready for action?

00:15:42.744 --> 00:15:45.654
An aircraft is going to hit
the Ippongi Tower building?

00:15:46.154 --> 00:15:48.624
The probability level is 88%!

00:15:48.624 --> 00:15:50.994
We expect it to happen in the next 15 minutes.

00:15:50.994 --> 00:15:54.084
We've closed the local airspace, but the
probability level hasn't changed.

00:15:54.664 --> 00:15:57.294
We want The Children there on standby.

00:15:57.294 --> 00:15:58.294
Roger.

00:15:58.294 --> 00:16:00.134
"Normal kids," huh?

00:16:00.134 --> 00:16:01.434
Kaoru...

00:16:01.434 --> 00:16:03.694
What, is that still bugging you?

00:16:04.074 --> 00:16:08.664
Forget it... He probably won't
last long with us, either.

00:16:09.644 --> 00:16:10.974
I suppose.

00:16:14.084 --> 00:16:17.314
Telling us to act like normal kids...

00:16:21.054 --> 00:16:22.914
What's wrong, Kaoru?

00:16:23.524 --> 00:16:24.994
No, it's nothing.

00:16:25.994 --> 00:16:28.964
One minute to the incident they predicted.

00:16:29.324 --> 00:16:31.894
But there's no sign of anything wrong.

00:16:31.894 --> 00:16:34.294
There're no aircraft around here, except...

00:16:35.104 --> 00:16:36.594
Unless!

00:16:38.034 --> 00:16:40.904
Pilot! Get us out of this airspace,
as fast as you can!

00:16:41.374 --> 00:16:43.864
Kaoru?
We're the only aircraft around here!

00:16:44.344 --> 00:16:46.714
WE'RE going to be the cause of the accident!

00:16:48.314 --> 00:16:52.084
I've lost control! We're in the grip
of some incredible force!

00:16:59.994 --> 00:17:01.114
Wh-What?!

00:17:01.494 --> 00:17:04.324
We're in trouble! Emergency teleport!

00:17:21.684 --> 00:17:23.304
Everyone okay?

00:17:24.614 --> 00:17:26.254
Where's Kaoru?

00:17:26.254 --> 00:17:28.514
I thought I teleported her with us.

00:17:29.524 --> 00:17:30.754
Kaoru!

00:17:31.394 --> 00:17:31.884
Wha?!

00:17:34.324 --> 00:17:36.024
K-Kaoru!

00:17:37.394 --> 00:17:41.564
No... Stay back! STAY AWAY FROM ME!

00:17:42.904 --> 00:17:44.494
What are you talking about?

00:17:47.404 --> 00:17:48.844
What are you doing?!

00:17:48.844 --> 00:17:51.014
It's not on purpose!

00:17:51.014 --> 00:17:54.344
My power's just acting on its own! I can't stop it!

00:17:55.614 --> 00:17:57.914
Her psychic power's out of control.

00:18:00.554 --> 00:18:01.624
Hey, Minamoto.

00:18:01.624 --> 00:18:04.244
What is it? I'm kinda busy here!

00:18:04.424 --> 00:18:06.794
I just got the results of Kaoru's scan.

00:18:06.794 --> 00:18:09.594
It detected slight damage to her brain cells.

00:18:09.594 --> 00:18:12.994
It'll probably heal on its own in a few
days, but if any trouble starts-

00:18:12.994 --> 00:18:14.264
It already has!

00:18:14.264 --> 00:18:14.794
What?
It already has!

00:18:16.904 --> 00:18:20.464
Hold it. Turning on her limiter should help.

00:18:29.244 --> 00:18:30.314
Kaoru!

00:18:30.314 --> 00:18:32.644
I'll bring a spare limiter control back from HQ!

00:18:34.354 --> 00:18:36.054
K-Kaoru!

00:18:36.054 --> 00:18:38.614
Boy... This is gonna suck, destroying myself...

00:18:39.154 --> 00:18:41.264
Level 7 psychokinesis...

00:18:41.264 --> 00:18:44.384
It can easily tear a child's body apart!

00:18:47.904 --> 00:18:51.024
You... What are you doing?!

00:18:56.704 --> 00:18:58.274
Stop it, you idiot!

00:18:58.274 --> 00:19:01.644
I can't control it like usual! I'll break your spine!

00:19:01.944 --> 00:19:05.674
All the more reason! Now lie
still! That's an order!

00:19:20.864 --> 00:19:22.524
Minamoto...

00:19:23.004 --> 00:19:25.734
Aoi will be back soon.

00:19:25.734 --> 00:19:27.704
Just lie still till then!

00:19:30.674 --> 00:19:32.334
Forget it.

00:19:34.884 --> 00:19:37.974
Kaoru! What are you?!

00:19:38.714 --> 00:19:42.754
My power's out of control because
of brain damage, right?

00:19:42.754 --> 00:19:46.624
So, if it stops getting oxygen, this should stop.

00:19:53.194 --> 00:19:57.034
But why? Why can't I go to kindergarten?

00:19:57.974 --> 00:20:01.404
Kaoru, your powers are just too strong.

00:20:01.404 --> 00:20:04.274
For the other childrens' safety, you can't go.

00:20:04.814 --> 00:20:08.244
Other children? But, what about me?

00:20:11.314 --> 00:20:13.284
Don't I matter?

00:20:13.284 --> 00:20:16.824
Why? Because I have this power?

00:20:16.824 --> 00:20:19.054
Is my power bad?

00:20:19.054 --> 00:20:21.524
Why? Why am I special?

00:20:21.524 --> 00:20:23.224
Why?

00:20:28.934 --> 00:20:29.954
Kaoru.

00:20:34.344 --> 00:20:36.364
Come back.

00:20:48.654 --> 00:20:50.454
C'mon! C'mon!

00:20:50.694 --> 00:20:52.984
Kaoru! Come back!

00:20:55.264 --> 00:20:59.424
Come back, Kaoru! COME BACK,
YOU LITTLE IDIOT!

00:21:02.064 --> 00:21:03.034
Kaoru!
Kaoru!

00:21:04.634 --> 00:21:05.264
Kaoru!

00:21:10.844 --> 00:21:12.414
Good idea, huh?

00:21:12.414 --> 00:21:14.204
Don't joke about that!

00:21:14.944 --> 00:21:16.814
Not so loud.

00:21:19.584 --> 00:21:21.914
I was so worried.

00:21:29.764 --> 00:21:31.384
MINAMOTO!

00:21:31.764 --> 00:21:34.804
What were you thinking?!

00:21:34.804 --> 00:21:37.604
Those girls are national treasures!

00:21:37.604 --> 00:21:40.674
I told you to be careful in using them, didn't I?!

00:21:40.674 --> 00:21:41.144
Yes, sir...

00:21:41.144 --> 00:21:42.344
There are plenty of others who can do your job!
Yes, sir...

00:21:42.344 --> 00:21:43.444
There are plenty of others who can do your job!

00:21:43.444 --> 00:21:45.214
He's really getting it.

00:21:45.214 --> 00:21:47.274
Well, it's to be expected.

00:21:48.284 --> 00:21:51.114
Still... He's kind of fun to have
around, don't you think?

00:21:51.284 --> 00:21:54.514
Yeah. We won't be bored if he stays.

00:21:54.624 --> 00:21:55.984
Maybe we could prank him.

00:21:56.154 --> 00:21:58.394
Yeah, don't you think?

00:21:58.394 --> 00:22:00.964
But we'd better be careful
having a young man around.

00:22:00.964 --> 00:22:02.664
Huh? What do you mean?

00:22:02.664 --> 00:22:03.994
Well...

00:22:03.994 --> 00:22:05.934
Maybe...

00:22:05.934 --> 00:22:09.424
Maybe with him, things will work out just fine.

00:22:19.474 --> 00:22:24.614
Kakushitemo muda da yo

00:22:24.914 --> 00:22:28.974
Nandemo zenbu wakaru

00:22:29.724 --> 00:22:35.164
Fushigi ja nai yo datte atshi wa

00:22:35.524 --> 00:22:40.934
Anata wo ai shite n da mon

00:22:41.164 --> 00:22:45.574
Hora kochi muite

00:22:45.834 --> 00:22:50.144
Maji de love x love musubaru no wa

00:22:50.144 --> 00:22:52.114
Zettai nan desu!

00:22:52.344 --> 00:22:57.054
Zutto eien fuhen

00:22:57.054 --> 00:23:03.694
Endless kara sekaiju ni zettai sengen!

00:23:03.694 --> 00:23:08.524
Mou uketomtete

00:23:08.524 --> 00:23:12.934
Futari love x love musubaru no wa

00:23:12.934 --> 00:23:15.134
Zettai nan desu!

00:23:15.134 --> 00:23:19.574
Yappa daian kibou

00:23:19.874 --> 00:23:23.974
San Pietro de chikau ai no

00:23:23.974 --> 00:23:26.774
Zettai sengen!

00:23:39.994 --> 00:23:40.924
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:40.924 --> 00:23:42.914
NEXT EPISODE
