This is Mr. Minamoto's apartment?

00:23:45.494 --> 00:23:48.364
He hardly has any luggage!
Wonderful! This'll be perfect!

00:23:48.364 --> 00:23:52.174
This was the only one he could move into
quickly that was close to BABEL HQ.

00:23:52.174 --> 00:23:55.604
Okay, special agents of BABEL!
We'll leave the heavy lifting to you!

00:23:55.604 --> 00:23:57.874
